 ### [Quantization](5935-quantization.md)
-Quantization reduces the precision of volume data values to lower memory footprint and bandwidth requirements, serving as the primary lossy compression step in transform-based and neural volume rendering pipelines. It differs from its siblings by focusing on the discretization of scalar or vector values (colors, normals, densities) rather than the structural encoding of the data hierarchy or the entropy coding of the resulting symbols.
